# "You may play lands ... from your graveyard": Bot1 puts a Mountain into its graveyard with Entomb, casts Yawgmoth's Will, and plays the
# Mountain from the graveyard as its land play for the turn (so a Swamp from the hand is then refused). The Mountain taps for {R}. Entomb,
# put into the graveyard before the Will, stays there; the Will itself is exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Entomb
Yawgmoth's Will
Swamp
Mountain
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Mountain)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Yawgmoth's Will.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Graveyard.Mountain.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Entomb
Exile = Yawgmoth's Will
